{"parse": {"title": "独一律", "pageid": 2234, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"独一律\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/26/Item-140001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"独一律\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>独一律</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#140001</div></div><hr /><div>毋须编织的、独一无二的线，可使纺车转动一周。<br />用于角色的征集。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">金兔子的传说广为人知。它窥探人群，偷走人们的时间，甚至改变人生的轨迹。它是陈旧、腐朽、老掉牙的，但更是独一无二、无可替代的。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "独一律"}}